[{"key":"1piwt58172htca","text":"A snack is guarded when another snack could eat whoever takes it. Guarded snacks bite back!"},{"key":"14i2n4k1nil166","text":"Oops, it's a tie: the king had no moves but wasn't in check! Try another move."},{"key":"03l96sm0bzjl32","text":"En passant: capture a pawn that just moved two squares, as if it moved one."},{"key":"07inc2x0vyqk4l","text":"Every piece is worth candy! Pawn 1, knight 3, bishop 3, rook 5, queen 9!"},{"key":"0xldyxp0bfle53","text":"Hmm, there's a stronger move. Look for a check that hits two pieces!"},{"key":"04ueu301jnk4w6","text":"Oh! My pawn got to the other side first. Good game! Want a rematch?"},{"key":"068lq9c04jdtd0","text":"Each player has one light-square bishop and one dark-square bishop."},{"key":"04eodis0udevtk","text":"The queen attacks the king. That's check! He can still get away."},{"key":"0ml5wlh0hrqw3f","text":"I captured your king! Good game. Keep your king safe next time!"},{"key":"0p0efsx06in2v9","text":"Point out that a bishop always stays on the same color square."},{"key":"1bb6kqs0ll83gu","text":"Kids mode is locked on this device. Turn it off in Grown-ups."},{"key":"0mxjenl1d1pcx7","text":"The queen attacks the king and he can't escape. Checkmate!"},{"key":"07ojp9n03ad9ot","text":"Every move must eat a snack! Eat them all with the bishop."},{"key":"0mwy46t0nv71pf","text":"The pawn attacks the king and he can't escape. Checkmate!"},{"key":"1oy7ybt0b9n3yp","text":"Every move must eat a snack! Eat them all with the king."},{"key":"0cfc99418dgtoa","text":"Shelly found this checkmate. Let's remember that trick!"},{"key":"19n4m1y0y4uv3s","text":"Make the box smaller! Squeeze the king, then checkmate."},{"key":"1ortn7114r0bwv","text":"Bruno found this checkmate. Let's remember that trick!"},{"key":"058mr55025vky7","text":"Careful! The king could gobble your queen. Try again!"},{"key":"1t4111y0llezh4","text":"Rooks move in straight lines, like a train on tracks!"},{"key":"02v64ds10uvy08","text":"A PIN is set: the gate asks for it instead of a sum."},{"key":"1iq30sl0un1d1r","text":"Stalemate: no legal moves and not in check. A draw."},{"key":"0dzn8g80m48nlc","text":"Oops, Shelly left a bishop alone! Can you find it?"},{"key":"1hhpis30higamv","text":"Set up the back row! Tap a piece, then its square."},{"key":"0nzibn51sawidx","text":"Reset this kid's settings to the new age defaults?"},{"key":"19svlty165dr56","text":"Oops, Ember left a knight alone! Can you find it?"},{"key":"1t0ysyp15m7wbx","text":"Crown Tower! At the top, your pawn becomes royal."},{"key":"0wi1z4n0pjqrep","text":"Oops, Shelly left a pawn alone! Can you find it?"},{"key":"04qzvno0cua53e","text":"Oops, Fern left a knight alone! Can you find it?"},{"key":"1vvh8mt0dhjn09","text":"The knight gives check, but the king can escape."},{"key":"12m8e4d0d4si39","text":"What does the knight want? Keep your queen safe!"},{"key":"14l7ggl00u0cn7","text":"Oops, Fern left a queen alone! Can you find it?"},{"key":"1gxslfi09ai9w6","text":"Oops, Bruno left a pawn alone! Can you find it?"},{"key":"0mad6mr1eohio5","text":"This is the bishop. She slides on slanty lines!"},{"key":"17hjhyd162qlot","text":"What does the pawn want? Keep your bishop safe!"},{"key":"18b6fl21o2ejqo","text":"Pip is resting. Come back after a little break!"},{"key":"0xr0naz1aq1ux3","text":"Oops, Tuck left a pawn alone! Can you find it?"},{"key":"1633gyz01504ql","text":"The king gives check, but the king can escape."},{"key":"1ye9gz70yuwm53","text":"Defend the rook on d one. Only one move works."},{"key":"0ccaccy0zb6xj0","text":"Every piece makes lava where it could capture."},{"key":"1abt8vx0gockwn","text":"Oops, Hop left a pawn alone! Can you find it?"},{"key":"0yki37x1ux5zch","text":"Pawn War! Get a pawn to the other side first!"},{"key":"14mcyix0o11zpt","text":"Your turn! Tap every square the rook can go."},{"key":"0t8krcb0qoyrxd","text":"Pawn 1, knight 3, bishop 3, rook 5, queen 9."},{"key":"0u4hue00me7k9y","text":"Bishop Woods! Bishops slide on slanty paths."},{"key":"1j889pa0m5ixqy","text":"The king moves one square in any direction."},{"key":"0be1xsu037dgvo","text":"Trading a knight for a rook is a good deal!"},{"key":"1tach9k1d0ka6g","text":"Ember is napping, Olive will play instead."},{"key":"04fvyij08w2r6t","text":"Two steps and a turn. Try every direction!"},{"key":"0rgo70c0j9205k","text":"Your knight is in danger! Give it a guard."},{"key":"0qd0wks18z9r1i","text":"Stop showing Pip? You can try again later."},{"key":"14l56l11iw7e8x","text":"Nobody is attacking the king. He is calm!"},{"key":"10kj6670kc09i9","text":"Find the fork! Attack two things at once."},{"key":"0zuqh3s0pr3crq","text":"Hi! I'm Pip. Let's make your chess buddy!"},{"key":"1x1dkr4172rado","text":"The Crown! Beat Fern the fox to earn it!"},{"key":"0123un605e4vam","text":"Pawn Parade! Little pawns march forward."},{"key":"1yw1i6m13xdh38","text":"A pawn on the last row becomes a queen!"},{"key":"00dmrup144pxg3","text":"Race a pawn to the end to make a queen!"},{"key":"1pose770zk2e95","text":"Pawn War! Get a pawn to the other side!"},{"key":"0dfxvs50dxitnp","text":"Leave the king a square, or give check!"},{"key":"185j62i07qgb8o","text":"First the letter a, then the number 6."},{"key":"0dsm5sx0u81nhj","text":"First the letter b, then the number 4."},{"key":"1d48za01gpmzqe","text":"First the letter c, then the number 2."},{"key":"1m0he2q1gpmzvw","text":"First the letter c, then the number 8."},{"key":"0imrudh0464a5n","text":"First the letter d, then the number 6."},{"key":"125uaj80qnpmei","text":"First the letter e, then the number 4."},{"key":"1q6ok9n1d5aynd","text":"First the letter f, then the number 2."},{"key":"0hrx8a91d5aysv","text":"First the letter f, then the number 8."},{"key":"1adeoio00ls92m","text":"First the letter g, then the number 6."},{"key":"1657par0n3dlbh","text":"First the letter h, then the number 4."},{"key":"0l9cgf81c5k684","text":"Look for checks, captures and attacks!"},{"key":"0njm15w07jlsiy","text":"