1y97obe","text":"The rook can't reach the cookie."},{"key":"1wy9ycr1x7j1uv","text":"Keep your king safe from danger!"},{"key":"0fwb4ha0ppdmrq","text":"That square is not on the road."},{"key":"07s5ua71larm6r","text":"That's the rook! Find the pawn."},{"key":"1544obv0e222hp","text":"Capture the Crown. rook's turn."},{"key":"15ipg5a0ulcgew","text":"Checkmate in 13 moves! Amazing!"},{"key":"03z3z6e07d2phk","text":"Chess board: play with a friend"},{"key":"0olzz9d19zfef3","text":"Bishops join. Checkmate to win."},{"key":"0gll18911tzlmp","text":"Straight to walk, slanty to eat"},{"key":"16601ai0nse8ee","text":"Pawns stand in a row in front."},{"key":"1yjf4x00y09siw","text":"Checkmate in 4 moves! Amazing!"},{"key":"0t119mf0czi1lb","text":"Bishops slide on slanty lines."},{"key":"0un6td30v4byol","text":"The Rook Maze! Get every star!"},{"key":"160icg6001jwdu","text":"The map labels will fade away!"},{"key":"0fpjijs14bt856","text":"A guarded snack can bite back!"},{"key":"0hw95br0dnlesh","text":"Castling is not allowed here."},{"key":"1049zya0bwoaq2","text":"Capture the bishop on d four."},{"key":"0zf2mae1639ebq","text":"Is this capture a good trade?"},{"key":"0qo3sxr1lx7xm7","text":"Great job! You kept thinking."},{"key":"0eofsa71njlqg7","text":"Pawn war board. rook's turn."},{"key":"0mas4p40ihpt44","text":"Where is the bishop? Tap it!"},{"key":"0koquwc11vdvl0","text":"Press Reset and start again."},{"key":"0bzgifc1wmybv2","text":"Only 14! You found them all!"},{"key":"1o6w0n20tkwxt0","text":"A long trip. Plan your road!"},{"key":"1q9cl4t1elxikf","text":"Give check! Attack the king."},{"key":"19uri211dn22ht","text":"Earn a gold crown on a world"},{"key":"0r8nd4e0i968ok","text":"Press and hold for 2 seconds"},{"key":"0nto8um1yxtkws","text":"Only 3! You found them all!"},{"key":"0vl9lr01cr3raa","text":"Only 9! You found them all!"},{"key":"0r5w3f30ma5t7n","text":"Capture the rook on g four."},{"key":"0mkdw311dpohfl","text":"Find each way out of check."},{"key":"00fg8xu0og3bb